# 5. DATA SOURCE OF TRUTH

Establish and enforce a clear source-of-truth hierarchy:

1. Database records and validated domain services are authoritative.
2. Backend APIs expose validated business data.
3. Frontend state reflects backend responses.
4. UI components display the current authoritative state.

The frontend must not independently fabricate financial or statutory values.

